{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 14 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 与神经场：表示能力、投影一致性和不可辨识性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D-to-3D &amp; Neural Fields</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting-title\">3D Gaussian Splatting</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">显式优化各向异性 3D Gaussians，并通过屏幕空间 splatting 与自适应增密实现实时 radiance rendering。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Represents 3D scenes explicitly as millions of anisotropic 3D Gaussians (position, covariance, opacity, spherical harmonics) rendered in real time via differentiable tile-based rasterization.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">带标定多视角 RGB 图像与 SfM/点云初始化</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Calibrated multi-view images and initial sparse point cloud</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">可实时新视角渲染的显式 3D Gaussian 集合</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Explicit set of anisotropic 3D Gaussians supporting &gt;100 FPS real-time novel-view synthesis</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://repo-sam.inria.fr/fungraph/3d-gaussian-splatting/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"3D Gaussian Splatting original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0d4e76d63e3e92fce513.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">多视角图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">已知相机内外参与监督 RGB</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests calibrated multi-view images and initial sparse point cloud and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"已知相机内外参与监督 RGB\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests calibrated multi-view images and initial sparse point cloud and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"多视角图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多视角图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">已知相机内外参与监督 RGB</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests calibrated multi-view images and initial sparse point cloud and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 SfM 点云初始化 Gaussian 中心和颜色\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"稀疏点初始化\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">稀疏点初始化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 SfM 点云初始化 Gaussian 中心和颜色</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 primitive 有位置、各向异性协方差、opacity 与球谐颜色\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Gaussians within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"3D Gaussians\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Gaussians\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Gaussians</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 primitive 有位置、各向异性协方差、opacity 与球谐颜色</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Gaussians within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用视图 Jacobian 将 3D covariance 投影为 2D 椭圆 footprint\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"屏幕投影\" data-node-name-en=\"projection\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">屏幕投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用视图 Jacobian 将 3D covariance 投影为 2D 椭圆 footprint</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"tile-based visibility-aware rasterization，按深度累积 primitive\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Splat within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"排序 Splat\" data-node-name-en=\"Splat\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">排序 Splat</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Splat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">tile-based visibility-aware rasterization，按深度累积 primitive</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Splat within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"前到后 opacity compositing 得到像素颜色\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Alpha within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Alpha 合成\" data-node-name-en=\"Alpha\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Alpha 合成</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Alpha</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">前到后 opacity compositing 得到像素颜色</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Alpha within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"L1 与结构相似度等比较渲染和观测图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs loss within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"光度损失\" data-node-name-en=\"loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">光度损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">L1 与结构相似度等比较渲染和观测图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs loss within the core explicit gaussian radiance splatting computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"依据梯度分裂、克隆或删除 Gaussians，自适应分配容量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 08 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"增密 / 剪枝\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">增密 / 剪枝</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">依据梯度分裂、克隆或删除 Gaussians，自适应分配容量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 08 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"优化后的显式 primitive 可快速 rasterize 新视角\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces explicit set of anisotropic 3d gaussians supporting &gt;100 fps real-time novel-view synthesis via Stage 09.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"实时渲染\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_074_3d_gaussian_splatting', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">实时渲染</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">优化后的显式 primitive 可快速 rasterize 新视角</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces explicit set of anisotropic 3d gaussians supporting &gt;100 fps real-time novel-view synthesis via Stage 09.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"3D Gaussian Splatting Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 3D 协方差投影与前向 alpha 合成</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Projective 3D-to-2D 