.548365 .158807C1.548365 .34739 1.389559 .794034 .734481 1.210901L.82381 1.399484C1.121572 1.30023 1.935457 .645152 1.935457-.059553Z\" id=\"m074_g16-150\"></path></defs><g id=\"m074_page1\"><use x=\"-68.911584\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g1-6\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"-62.409485\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g7-48\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"-62.6949\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-56.092631\"></use><use x=\"-56.584027\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g1-61\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"-47.22143\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-31\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"-42.798015\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"-39.937106\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-44\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"-30.651937\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g1-6\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"-24.435254\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"-21.574345\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-44\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"-12.388805\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g7-62\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"-6.453461\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-31\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"-1.392453\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g7-62\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"-2.030046\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-56.092631\"></use><use x=\"4.283862\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"18.347736\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-24\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"28.367854\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g1-61\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"37.471423\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g4-213\" y=\"-69.011212\"></use><use x=\"42.750804\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-47.47246\"></use><use x=\"52.421976\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-50\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"57.204049\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"60.393725\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-85\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"66.301574\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"71.081912\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g4-214\" y=\"-69.011212\"></use><use x=\"73.058885\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-57\" y=\"-47.47246\"></use><use x=\"75.967972\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-159\" y=\"-47.47246\"></use><use x=\"81.073426\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-56\" y=\"-47.47246\"></use><use x=\"85.079411\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"88.795471\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g20-49\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"95.990657\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g10-0\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"104.610497\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g16-85\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"111.609254\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g13-57\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"114.863746\" xlink:href=\"#m074_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">NeRF 每射线 MLP 查询使训练与渲染较慢</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Continuous coordinate MLPs in NeRF required querying hundreds of points along every ray, bottlenecking real-time rendering and interactive editing.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以显式各向异性 3D Gaussians 和 visibility-aware splatting 表示场景</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Replace implicit continuous MLPs with explicit 3D Gaussian primitives projected directly to 2D screen space via closed-form EWA covariance splatting.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">直接优化 Gaussian 位置、协方差、不透明度和颜色，实现实时渲染</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Anisotropic 3D covariance optimization (R S S^T R^T) + adaptive clone/split/prune density control + fast tile-based GPU sorting rasterizer.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">启发 X-ray radiative Gaussian splatting 和动态 tomography</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Rapidly adapted to surgical endoscopy 3D reconstruction (EndoGaussian) and radiative X-ray Gaussian tomography (R2-Gaussian).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">实时渲染优势真实；不自动保证 HU、解剖或成像物理</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Genuine real-time rendering breakthrough; discrete Gaussian primitives can still produce needle-like artifacts under sparse views.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">以显式各向异性 Gaussian primitives 替代每射线 MLP 查询，交换部分内存以换取实时 rasterization。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">3D covariance 经相机投影成为屏幕椭圆，并通过可微 alpha compositing 参与图像损失。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">增密和剪枝让表示容量随场景细节自适应，而非固定 voxel 分辨率。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Replace implicit continuous MLPs with explicit 3D Gaussian primitives projected directly to 2D screen space via closed-form EWA covariance splatting.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Anisotropic 3D covariance optimization (R S S^T R^T) + adaptive clone/split/prune density control + fast tile-based GPU sorting rasterizer.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Projective 3D-to-2D Covariance Splatting &amp; Front-to-Back Alpha Compositing.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可启发内镜/术野新视角、动态解剖可视化和医学 X-ray Gaussian renderer。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">原始 RGB opacity compositing 不保证 HU、attenuation 或患者解剖真实性；医学应用必须重写物理和定量验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Rapidly adapted to surgical endoscopy 3D reconstruction (EndoGaussian) and radiative X-ray Gaussian tomography (R2-Gaussian).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Genuine real-time rendering breakthrough; discrete Gaussian primitives can still produce needle-like artifacts under sparse views.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://repo-sam.inria.fr/fungraph/3d-gaussian-splatting/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>3D Gaussian Splatting for Real-Time Radiance Field Rendering</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/graphdeco-inria/gaussian-splatting\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}